# Headings: Number label writes what goes before the title, with {number} where the number goes.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: Headings · Number label
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 20mm
	Styles:
		For element: Heading 2
			Typography:
				Numbered: true
				Number label: Chapter {number}.
		For style: annex
			Typography:
				Numbered: true
				Number format: upper-alpha
				Number label: Appendix {number}:
	Section:
		Text: Headings
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Number label
		Paragraph: Without `Number label` the number goes alone before the title. With it, the label replaces the number and `{number}` says where the number goes. `{{number of: id}}` still writes only the number.
			Style: intro
		Heading 2:
			Text: Introduction
		Text: Number label: Chapter {number}.
			Style: label
		Heading 2:
			Text: Results
		Paragraph: The rates are in appendix {number of: fees}, and the contacts in appendix {number of: contacts}.
		Heading 2:
			Typography:
				Numbered: false
			Text: Appendices
		Text: Number label: Appendix {number}: with Number format: upper-alpha
			Style: label
		Heading 3:
			Style: annex
			Id: fees
			Text: Fees
		Heading 3:
			Style: annex
			Id: contacts
			Text: Contacts
